"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s ","type":"text"},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","title":"Swami","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/underline(_:pattern:color:)":{"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/underline(_:pattern:color:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/underline(_:pattern:color:)","abstract":[],"title":"underline(_:pattern:color:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"underline"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"pattern"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Text"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV9LineStyleV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"LineStyle"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4TextV9LineStyleV7PatternV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Pattern"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"ki